  Slug: ruby-phoenix-fanatic
  DisplayName: Ruby Phoenix Fanatic
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: "Have you heard of the peerless sorcerer Hao Jin, also known as the
    Ruby Phoenix? Of course you have! You're her biggest fan! She's got amazing powers
    of self-resurrection, her hair is as red and fiery as a phoenix, and she has
    a huge vault full of the most incredible treasures in the multiverse. Now she's
    finally back from a mysterious 300-year quest on the plane of Axis so she can
    host this year's Ruby Phoenix Tournament\u2014and you can't wait to meet her!
    In order to get as close to Hao Jin as possible, you've researched everything
    there is to know about the Ruby Phoenix's home, her planar escapades, and her
    competition. You've also trained your body to prove yourself a worthy champion.
    When Hao Jin's committee invited you and some friends to take part in the tournament's
    prequalifier, you just about fainted from excitement. Is your dream of meeting
    the Ruby Phoenix about to come true? As long as you win enough matches to get
    into the actual tournament, it just might! Just try not to act too star-struck
    when you finally get a chance to talk to her, okay? Choose two attribute boosts.
    One must be to Constitution or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Axis Lore, Gladiatorial Lore, and Goka Lore skills. You
    gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Dubious Knowledge] skill feat."
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Fists of the Ruby Phoenix Player's Guide
  SourcePack: backgrounds
  Rarity: rare
